 global biocide regulations, including but not limited to US EPA′s Federal Insecticide Fungicide and Rodenticide Act, European Biocidal Products Regulation, Canada’s Pest Management Regulatory Agency, Turkey’s Biocidal Products Regulation, Korea’s Consumer Chemical Products and Biocide Safety Management Act (K-BPR) and others.\nL229: \nL230: * * *\nL231: ## Compare Similar Items\nL232: \nL233: 【18†View Full Comparison】\nL234: \nL235: * * *\nL236: \nL237: Show Differences\nL238: \nL239: [Input]\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4-Hydroxymandelic acid monohydrate 97% | Sigma-Aldrich (https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/168327)\nciteturn115view2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/aldrich/168327\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 169\nL0: 【0†Skip to Content】\nL1: \nL2: US EN\nL3: \nL4: 【1†Image: 4-Hydroxymandelic acid monohydrate 97%】\nL5: \nL6: 【2†Image: 4-Hydroxymandelic acid monohydrate 97%】\nL7: \nL8: ### Key Documents\nL9: \nL10:   * 【3†COA】\nL11: \nL12:   * 【3†COO】\nL13: \nL14: 【3†View All Documentation】\nL15: \nL16: 168327\nL17: \nL18: 【4†Image: Sigma-Aldrich】\nL19: \nL20: Share\nL21: \nL22: # 4-Hydroxymandelic acid monohydrate\nL23: \nL24: ## 97%\nL25: \nL26: 【5†Sign In】 to View Organizational & Contract Pricing.\nL27: \nL28: ### Select a Size\nL29: \nL30: Change View\nL31: \nL32: * * *\nL33: ### About This Item\nL34: \nL35: Linear Formula:\nL36: \nL37: HOC_{6}H_{4}CH(OH)CO_{2}H · H_{2}O\nL38: \nL39: CAS Number:\nL40: \nL41: 【6†184901-84-6】\nL42: \nL43: Molecular Weight:\nL44: \nL45: 186.16\nL46: \nL47: PubChem Substance ID:\nL48: \nL49: 【7†24850239†pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL50: \nL51: UNSPSC Code:\nL52: \nL53: 12352100\nL54: \nL55: MDL number:\nL56: \nL57: 【8†MFCD00149283】\nL58: \nL59: Beilstein/REAXYS Number:\nL60: \nL61: 2365374\nL62: \nL63: Technical Service\nL64: \nL65: Need help? Our team of experien